  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-01-17T00:49:18.316Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Some people tend to swap between multiple avatars in a short period of time. On Quest this can easily cause crashes with the Quest's low ram. PCs with low specs can also crash.\n\nI think that there should be the optional client-sided ability to limit the amount of times people can change avatars within a specific amount of time before VRChat either forces them into a Fallback, Robot, or Diamond. This can be overriden per person with a separate \"Allow user to swap between multiple avatars\" part. With the user having the ability to customize x many times within y amount of time.",
